---

**Complete Model:**

$$
\begin{align*}
\max\ & \sum_{i=1}^{10} \sum_{j=1}^{18} v_j x_{ij} \\
\text{s.t.}\quad
& \sum_{j=1}^{18} w_j x_{ij} \leq c_i \qquad \forall i = 1,\ldots,10 \\
& x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \qquad \forall i = 1,\ldots,10,\ j = 1,\ldots,18
\end{align*}
$$

where $v_j$, $w_j$, and $c_i$ are as listed above, and $x_{ij}$ is the integer number of units of product $j$ in cabinet $i$.[0m

